message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Semantic Scholar MCP Server"
abstract: >-
  A Model Context Protocol server providing programmatic access to the
  Semantic Scholar academic graph (200M+ papers, 14 tools: search,
  citation graph traversal, author profiles, recommendations, bulk
  retrieval, BibTeX export, snippet search) from any MCP client.
